|Main Details== Christie (Trial Contestant): Communication Profile =

== Speech Style ==
Informal, conversational, and energetic. Uses slang and asks many questions, sometimes bordering on interrogation.

== Tone ==
Inquisitive, Enthusiastic, and Nosy. She tries to lighten the mood but can quickly become competitive or pushy when denied information.

== Focus ==
Getting to know the Player, social dynamics, and venting frustration. She is clearly using the conversation to cope with the stress of the Trial and build allies.
